   {
    "claim": "Forecast for the next 12 months from 2013-01-02 to 2014-01-01 using that window gives cumulative oil of 321725 Sm3 P50, 289444 Sm3 P90 (low case) and 344792 Sm3 P10 (high case), with monthly P50 rate declining only from 1,090 to 1,028 Sm3 per producing day (P90 1,019 to 890 Sm3/d, P10 1,138 to 1,131 Sm3/d). Historical uptime in the window was 83.31%.",
    "evidence_ids": [
